.TH MATRIXCODE 6x "June 2026" "matrixcode 0.1.0" "XScreenSaver manual"
.SH NAME
matrixcode \- lightweight OpenGL digital code rain
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B matrixcode
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B matrixcode
renders a fixed grid of custom, half-width glyphs whose brightness is animated
by independently falling illumination pulses.  The renderer uses X11 and
legacy OpenGL/GLX so it can run as an XScreenSaver hack without requiring a
programmable shader pipeline.
.PP
The glyphs are original clean-room artwork inspired by katakana, mirrored
forms, digits, and punctuation.  No film assets or third-party fonts are
included.
.SH WINDOW OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-root
Draw on the root window.
.TP
.BR \-window
Create a test window.  This is the default outside XScreenSaver.
.TP
.BI \-window-id " ID"
Draw in an existing X window.  The XSCREENSAVER_WINDOW environment variable is
also recognized.
.TP
.BI \-geometry " WIDTHxHEIGHT"
Set the test-window size.  The default is 960x540.
.SH VISUAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-fps " N"
Cap rendering at 5 to 120 frames per second.  Default: 30.
.TP
.BI \-delay " MICROSECONDS"
Set the frame delay directly.  This overrides \-fps.
.TP
.BI \-cell-size " N"
Set glyph height from 10 to 40 pixels.  Default: 18.
.TP
.BI \-density " N"
Set the percentage of columns carrying rain, from 10 to 90.  Default: 42.
.TP
.BI \-speed " N"
Set fall speed as a percentage, from 25 to 250.  Default: 100.
.TP
.BI \-trail " N"
Set nominal trail length from 6 to 40 cells.  Default: 18.
.TP
.BI \-cycle " N"
Set the rate of glyph mutation from 0 to 300 percent.  Default: 100.
.TP
.BI \-glow " N"
Set glow strength from 0 to 100.  Default: 68.
.TP
.BI \-contrast " N"
Set trail contrast from 20 to 100.  Default: 78.
.TP
.BI \-seed " N"
Use a deterministic random seed.
.TP
.BR \-no-vsync
Do not request a GLX swap interval.
.SH TESTING OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-frames " N"
Exit after rendering N frames.
.TP
.BI \-screenshot " FILE.ppm"
Save the last rendered frame as a binary PPM image.
.TP
.BR \-self-test
Run deterministic non-graphical tests and exit.
.TP
.BR \-verbose
Print GL implementation and grid diagnostics.
.TP
.BR \-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-help
Print command-line help and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/libexec/xscreensaver/matrixcode
The screen saver executable.
.TP
.I /usr/share/xscreensaver/config/matrixcode.xml
Preferences metadata used by xscreensaver-settings.
.SH PERFORMANCE
The default renderer uses one compact texture atlas, immediate-mode textured
quads, no per-frame allocation, no shaders, no framebuffers, and at most two
illumination pulses per active column.  Lower \-fps, increase \-cell-size, or
reduce \-density on very slow machines.
.SH AUTHORS
MatrixCode was written as an independent clean-room XScreenSaver hack.
.SH LICENSE
MIT/X11.
